      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yes please, i have to deal with many malicious users within multiple of my worlds on a daily/weekly basis, the most i've been able to do is setup very barebones udon admin tools but they still arent great or nearly as powerful as API-based methods such as what this would provide\nthis is a MUST HAVE for world creators who wish to benefit further from the world they created through the means of community management and wish to build a community within their public instances, i.e VRChat KMart or VRCValve's City 17, and so on",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
