      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While the overall request is good, this (as it's written) would only be suitable for **Public** instances. Would suck to be in a private world and be kicked by someone that was assigned the permission from the world author.\nThe other instance types would have temp roles for that specific instance.",
