  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-05-31T02:51:16.979Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having a World Management Tools would be great to have for VRChat, considering we the community create for the game.\nAllow World Creators to have the ability to create, remove, edit permissions for custom roles such as Administrators, Moderators or Supporters.\nWouldn't it be great if you can assign your friends Administrative powers in your world, where they can ban, kick, mute users?\nWhat about having a one click moderator assistant button for users who need help because not everyone wants to use the old voting system, clicking this will send a notification to the user in any other world similar to world invites, requests.\nWhat do you think? Do you have any other ideas or suggestions for World Management Tools?",
